---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="Which cookies this site uses and how to control them.">
  <article class="prose prose-neutral">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p>
      Cookies are small files stored in your browser. This site uses them sparingly, and only for
      the purposes below.
    </p>

    <h2>Categories we use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Essential.</strong> Remembers your cookie choice so the banner does not appear again.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics.</strong> Helps us understand which pages are useful. This is aggregated and
        does not identify you.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Advertising.</strong> Set by our advertising partners to measure and personalise ads.
        These only load after you accept.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
    <p>
      You can decline non-essential cookies in the consent banner, and you can clear or block cookies
      in your browser at any time. Blocking essential cookies does not break the site, but the
      banner may reappear.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
